      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Orwigsburg%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "By the early 1900s, Orwigsburg boasted 11 shoe factories, four knitting mills, a cigar factory, two schools, and four churches.",
